% Lesson 22 answers, runnable parts: run with the chase, not datalog.py.
%
%   python3 chase.py exercises/22-answers.dl

% --- exercise 4: every person has a parent, weakly acyclic ----------------
% Invented parents go into their own predicate, so they are never fed
% back into the rule that invents the next one.
person(ada).
parent(P, C)  :- person(C).
ancestor(P)   :- parent(P, _).

% --- exercise 6: the frozen body of q(E) :- employee(E). -------------------
% Freeze E as the constant e, chase, and look for works_in(e, _).
employee(e).
works_in(E, D) :- employee(E).
